OL,3,GNEWSAMan arrested after pedestrian dies
OL,4,Afollowing crash                        
OL,6,FA motorcyclist has been arrested in    
OL,7,Fconnection with a fatal crash involving
OL,8,Fa pedestrian.                          
OL,10,FDorset Police said it received a report
OL,11,Fof a crash on Bournemouth Road in the  
OL,12,FAshley Cross area of Poole involving a 
OL,13,Fred Honda motorcycle and a pedestrian  
OL,14,Fat 20:31 GMT on Sunday.                
OL,16,FThe pedestrian ` a man aged in his 50s 
OL,17,F` was taken to hospital in a           
OL,18,Flife-threatening condition, where he   
OL,19,Fdied in hospital on Tuesday. The force 
OL,20,Fsaid his family are aware.             
